#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: gatewaykit-pro.php
msgid "GatewayKit Pro – Payment Gateway for Elementor Forms"
msgstr "GatewayKit Pro – Zahlungs-Gateway für Elementor-Formulare"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: gatewaykit-pro.php
msgid "https://pourmirzai.com/gatewaykit"
msgstr "https://pourmirzai.com/gatewaykit"

#. Description of the plugin
#: gatewaykit-pro.php
msgid "Add-on for GatewayKit. Unlocks advanced Pro features: discount codes, advanced transaction log, per-form redirects, partial payments, currency selector, outgoing webhooks, and white-label branding. All payment gateways (Stripe, Mollie, CoinGate, Coinify, PayPal, NOWPayments) are now included in the free GatewayKit."
msgstr "Add-on für GatewayKit. Schaltet erweiterte Pro-Funktionen frei: Rabattcodes, erweitertes Transaktionsprotokoll, formulareigene Weiterleitungen, Teilzahlungen, Währungsauswahl, ausgehende Webhooks und White-Label-Branding. Alle Zahlungs-Gateways (Stripe, Mollie, CoinGate, Coinify, PayPal, NOWPayments) sind jetzt im kostenlosen GatewayKit enthalten."

#. Author of the plugin
#: gatewaykit-pro.php
msgid "Morteza Pourmirzai"
msgstr "Morteza Pourmirzai"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: gatewaykit-pro.php
msgid "https://pourmirzai.com"
msgstr "https://pourmirzai.com"

